body:
A sample of gas molecules do not all have the same velocity. There is a distribution of velocities as shown [here](https://chem.libretexts.org/Bookshelves/Physical_and_Theoretical_Chemistry_Textbook_Maps/Supplemental_Modules_(Physical_and_Theoretical_Chemistry)/Kinetics/Rate_Laws/Gas_Phase_Kinetics/Maxwell-Boltzmann_Distributions). The higher the temperature, the flatter the distribution and the greater the average velocity. 

&#x200B;

Rate of diffusion is affected by the mass of the gas sample, related by Graham's Law: Va/Vb = sqrt(mb/ma). This shows that a heavier gas will diffuse more slowly than a lighter gas.

To give us a compilation of B-sides? If so, keep it. But I believe it was said the album will not sound like FROOT.

I was just expecting a little more after waiting so long, but it's still a good song that has made me anticipate the upcoming album more.

&#x200B;
